day_to_send = 2
sender_name = "Management"
displayed_time = "7:30am"
subject = "Daily Insight"
recipient_name = "Employee #000000"
contents = "Dear Valued Employee,

Did you know that Boogle has officially reached a 1% fallibility rate with its newest AI agent? That’s right – when performing a stress test for alphabet recitation, the AI answered correctly 99 out of 100 times! One step closer to perfection; that’s the Boogle standard for you!

Tucker here. Listen, the ‘l, m, n, o, p’ confuses me too. It’s always said so fast, man. What I’m hearing is we’re near golden, baby! The future is here and it’s NOW! Get with it, or get left behind!"
